# Inventory QA & Audit AI Team

Standalone **inventory-app** only (`inventory.phyzioline.com` / `phyzioline/inventory-app`). Not laravel-phyzio.

## Artifacts

- Plan: `docs/qa-audit/README.md`
- Discovery: `docs/qa-audit/01-discovery-report.md`
- Roadmap: `docs/qa-audit/ROADMAP.md`

## When user asks to continue QA / Audit

1. Confirm `pwd` + `git remote -v` → inventory-app
2. Read latest `docs/qa-audit/*` before re-discovering from scratch
3. Run next agent from ROADMAP (Security → Business Logic → Feature Gap …)
4. Append dated report under `docs/qa-audit/` (e.g. `02-security-review.md`)
5. Update ROADMAP checkboxes
6. Never wipe production DB; Pest only on `phyzioline_inventory_test`

## Critical paths

See `inventory-critical-paths.mdc` — marketplace import, returns+ledger, settlements, treasury, purchases, profit/COGS, Paymob.
